# Reason: actual M4 paired-network trial reaches bpfloader exit0, then SurfaceFlinger/zygote fail because final Hybrid Vendor libgralloctypes imports common-V6, absent from A37.
# Affected: M4 runtime helper/lock, existing restore metadata loop, existing M4 real-ext4 image gate. Add one pinned S22 64-bit interface; retain A37 V7, Hybrid Vendor mapper and other donor files.
# Verify: helper apply/verify idempotence, bad-byte/symlink destination rejection, wrong milestone rejection, exact V6 source hash/ELF ABI inventory, real-ext4 metadata fixture, complete ordered source replay. Runtime acceptance remains separate.
# Rollback: reverse0192 and remove its series/lock entry; for a diagnostic device trial remove only the added V6 file and restore exact earlier APEX/BOOT/VENDOR snapshots. No radio/EFS writes or new kernel build.

